      "id": "FR-001",
      "title": "A plain \u0060landable\u0060 call on an otherwise-green PR MUST evaluate review acceptance and MUST return pending exit 7, naming the marker token, when no valid current-head chain exists. (covers AC-001, AC-006)",
      "text": "A plain \u0060landable\u0060 call on an otherwise-green PR MUST evaluate review acceptance and MUST return pending exit 7, naming the marker token, when no valid current-head chain exists. (covers AC-001, AC-006)",
